&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Develop&amp;nbsp;administrative software that enables communication between&amp;nbsp;system-level&amp;nbsp;software and&amp;nbsp;cluster-level&amp;nbsp;control layers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
