&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;$5,000 Bonus with Full Time Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
