&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is currently seeking an experienced&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Nurses Aide, CNA&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;full-time&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;opportunity to complete hospice&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;visits&lt;/strong&gt; to clients in facilities and homes located throughout &lt;strong&gt;Berks County.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
