&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Implement integumentary protective interventions to prevent wound formation and promote wound repair utilizing evidence-based dressings and topical agents&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Continually assess and revise the Physical Therapy - PT care plan&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
